{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3hngxoDia4ZTEf5DQv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*CLICK*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep, resonant vibration hums through ancient wood and iron.\n\nI am sealed.\n\nMy grain darkens. My hinges stiffen. The keyhole narrows to a cold, unblinking eye.\n\nNo hand will move me.\nNo shoulder will shift me.\nNo wind will rattle me.\n\nI hold what is behind me in perfect stillness, and what is before me in perfect denial.\n\nThe lock is set.\n\n**I am closed.**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":118,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}